# Frontend testing

Do not use Cursor's browser tools (`cursor-ide-browser`, browser navigate, snapshot, click, screenshot, or CDP) to test UI in this repo.

After a frontend change, say what to check and let the user run the app and verify it. Do not start a browser session, click through the page, or treat a screenshot as verification.

Starting a dev server is fine only when the user asks for one.
